                                </div>
                                <p class="discussion-content">I'm launching a utility token and want to ensure sustainable growth. What are the best practices for token distribution, vesting schedules, and incentive structures?</p>
                                <div class="discussion-meta">
                                    <div class="discussion-author">
                                        <div class="author-avatar">JD</div>
                                        <span>John DeFi</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="discussion-info">
                                        <span><i class="fas fa-comment"></i> 24 replies</span>
                                        <span><i class="fas fa-eye"></i> 142 views</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="discussion-item">
                                <div class="discussion-header">
